<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:01.700" end="00:00:04.199" style="s2">Get out.</p>
<p begin="00:00:03.000" end="00:00:05.900" style="s2">Now.</p>
<p begin="00:00:04.199" end="00:00:07.205" style="s2">Are you crazy? I&#39;m holding my</p>
<p begin="00:00:05.900" end="00:00:09.225" style="s2">baby.</p>
<p begin="00:00:07.205" end="00:00:09.225" style="s2">[crying and laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:00:09.699" end="00:00:15.399" style="s2">Jesus, she&#39;s still here. The suite</p>
<p begin="00:00:12.199" end="00:00:17.899" style="s2">belongs to Miss Ashcroft. I paid for it.</p>
<p begin="00:00:15.399" end="00:00:20.500" style="s2">You booked it twice. And we offered you</p>
<p begin="00:00:17.899" end="00:00:23.399" style="s2">a refund. I don&#39;t want a refund. I want</p>
<p begin="00:00:20.500" end="00:00:23.399" style="s2">what I paid for.</p>
<p begin="00:00:23.700" end="00:00:26.799" style="s2">She&#39;s making us late. Get her out.</p>
<p begin="00:00:26.200" end="00:00:30.200" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:00:26.799" end="00:00:30.200" style="s2">Stop. You are scaring him.</p>
<p begin="00:00:31.440" end="00:00:33.460" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:00:34.299" end="00:00:39.000" style="s2">Take the baby first.</p>
<p begin="00:00:36.900" end="00:00:42.400" style="s2">She said no. I can&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:00:39.000" end="00:00:42.400" style="s2">Do your damn job.</p>
<p begin="00:00:42.575" end="00:00:46.599" style="s2">[crying]</p>
<p begin="00:00:43.200" end="00:00:46.599" style="s2">Don&#39;t you touch my son.</p>
<p begin="00:00:46.799" end="00:00:51.200" style="s2">Fine.</p>
<p begin="00:00:47.799" end="00:00:52.099" style="s2">I&#39;ll go. Just let me keep him.</p>
<p begin="00:00:51.200" end="00:00:55.000" style="s2">Please.</p>
<p begin="00:00:52.099" end="00:00:55.000" style="s2">Was that so hard?</p>
<p begin="00:00:56.330" end="00:00:59.660" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:00:57.640" end="00:00:59.660" style="s2">[crying]</p>
<p begin="00:01:06.199" end="00:01:10.000" style="s2">You have no idea who you just messed</p>
<p begin="00:01:07.800" end="00:01:10.000" style="s2">with.</p>
<p begin="00:01:11.199" end="00:01:17.500" style="s2">Read it. Same room. Mine. What the hell?</p>
<p begin="00:01:14.300" end="00:01:20.800" style="s2">I checked in an hour ago.</p>
<p begin="00:01:17.500" end="00:01:22.800" style="s2">Right. Two confirmed bookings. So you</p>
<p begin="00:01:20.800" end="00:01:25.699" style="s2">screwed up.</p>
<p begin="00:01:22.800" end="00:01:26.900" style="s2">Fine. Fix it. We can refund you. Come</p>
<p begin="00:01:25.699" end="00:01:30.400" style="s2">back tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:01:26.900" end="00:01:33.500" style="s2">Tomorrow? I&#39;ve got a 10 month old.</p>
<p begin="00:01:30.400" end="00:01:36.000" style="s2">Not my problem, sweetheart.</p>
<p begin="00:01:33.500" end="00:01:38.099" style="s2">Then why don&#39;t you come back tomorrow?</p>
<p begin="00:01:36.000" end="00:01:39.599" style="s2">My dad is funding your hotel&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:01:38.099" end="00:01:41.300" style="s2">expansion.</p>
<p begin="00:01:39.599" end="00:01:44.099" style="s2">Of course you won&#39;t have to move. Hold</p>
<p begin="00:01:41.300" end="00:01:46.400" style="s2">on. Why does she get to stay?</p>
<p begin="00:01:44.099" end="00:01:48.731" style="s2">She&#39;s our priority guest. You don&#39;t look</p>
<p begin="00:01:46.400" end="00:01:50.751" style="s2">like you belong here.</p>
<p begin="00:01:48.731" end="00:01:50.751" style="s2">[crying]</p>
<p begin="00:01:55.300" end="00:01:58.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The investor reception starts soon.</p>
<p begin="00:01:56.599" end="00:02:00.000" style="s2">Operations want an answer. Mrs.</p>
<p begin="00:01:58.000" end="00:02:00.292" style="s2">Whitmore, I need you to cooperate.</p>
<p begin="00:02:00.000" end="00:02:01.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ask</p>
<p begin="00:02:00.292" end="00:02:03.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; to cooperate. Ask her to take the</p>
<p begin="00:02:01.892" end="00:02:05.992" style="s2">refund.</p>
<p begin="00:02:03.492" end="00:02:08.091" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No chance.</p>
<p begin="00:02:05.992" end="00:02:09.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There you go. Same answer.</p>
<p begin="00:02:08.091" end="00:02:13.792" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why am I the problem?</p>
<p begin="00:02:09.692" end="00:02:13.792" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because she isn&#39;t leaving. You are.</p>
<p begin="00:02:17.792" end="00:02:19.792" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re calling security for a booking</p>
<p begin="00:02:19.092" end="00:02:21.492" style="s2">mistake?</p>
<p begin="00:02:19.792" end="00:02:25.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We need the room cleared. Then clear</p>
<p begin="00:02:21.492" end="00:02:25.692" style="s2">hers. She booked it after me.</p>
<p begin="00:02:27.992" end="00:02:30.392" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have a reception downstairs. I&#39;m not</p>
<p begin="00:02:29.492" end="00:02:32.592" style="s2">moving.</p>
<p begin="00:02:30.392" end="00:02:33.392" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And I have a baby. You think I can sleep</p>
<p begin="00:02:32.592" end="00:02:34.692" style="s2">in a lobby?</p>
<p begin="00:02:33.392" end="00:02:36.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re holding everybody up.</p>
<p begin="00:02:34.692" end="00:02:39.792" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:02:36.892" end="00:02:41.392" style="s2">Your mistake is</p>
<p begin="00:02:39.792" end="00:02:42.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t stare at me.</p>
<p begin="00:02:41.392" end="00:02:44.292" style="s2">She&#39;s the problem.</p>
<p begin="00:02:42.492" end="00:02:46.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, come on. You know that&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:02:44.292" end="00:02:47.392" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Last offer. Refund, free breakfast, room</p>
<p begin="00:02:46.292" end="00:02:49.992" style="s2">tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:02:47.392" end="00:02:52.392" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My son needs a bed tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:02:49.992" end="00:02:53.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You have kids?</p>
<p begin="00:02:52.392" end="00:02:54.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah.</p>
<p begin="00:02:53.492" end="00:02:57.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then you know why I&#39;m not walking out</p>
<p begin="00:02:54.692" end="00:03:00.992" style="s2">with nowhere to go.</p>
<p begin="00:02:57.492" end="00:03:03.492" style="s2">Don&#39;t make this personal mark.</p>
<p begin="00:03:00.992" end="00:03:05.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You changed the system already.</p>
<p begin="00:03:03.492" end="00:03:05.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:03:17.792" end="00:03:21.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s enough. Nobody discusses internal</p>
<p begin="00:03:19.892" end="00:03:23.892" style="s2">records.</p>
<p begin="00:03:21.692" end="00:03:25.692" style="s2">Any vacant presidential suite?</p>
<p begin="00:03:23.892" end="00:03:27.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, ma&#39;am. Fully booked.</p>
<p begin="00:03:25.692" end="00:03:29.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So you sold one room twice and have</p>
<p begin="00:03:27.292" end="00:03:31.492" style="s2">nowhere to put me?</p>
<p begin="00:03:29.992" end="00:03:34.592" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re looking for options.</p>
<p begin="00:03:31.492" end="00:03:34.592" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then look faster.</p>
<p begin="00:03:35.592" end="00:03:39.792" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, little man. I know.</p>
<p begin="00:03:38.117" end="00:03:41.192" style="s2">[laughter] I know.</p>
<p begin="00:03:39.792" end="00:03:44.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can you shut that baby up?</p>
<p begin="00:03:41.192" end="00:03:46.392" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s a baby. What do you want me to do?</p>
<p begin="00:03:44.892" end="00:03:47.292" style="s2">No one wants to switch.</p>
<p begin="00:03:46.392" end="00:03:49.392" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There.</p>
<p begin="00:03:47.292" end="00:03:51.292" style="s2">We tried. Pack your things.</p>
<p begin="00:03:49.392" end="00:03:52.592" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You tried everybody except her.</p>
<p begin="00:03:51.292" end="00:03:55.392" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not some random guest.</p>
<p begin="00:03:52.592" end="00:03:55.392" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Neither am I.</p>
<p begin="00:03:57.692" end="00:04:00.392" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t crowd me.</p>
<p begin="00:03:59.092" end="00:04:03.594" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s getting scared.</p>
<p begin="00:04:00.392" end="00:04:07.194" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then stop dragging this out.</p>
<p begin="00:04:03.594" end="00:04:07.194" style="s2">We just wanted one quiet night.</p>
<p begin="00:04:08.594" end="00:04:11.994" style="s2">And I want my sweet.</p>
<p begin="00:04:13.094" end="00:04:15.094" style="s2">Get up.</p>
<p begin="00:04:14.194" end="00:04:17.417" style="s2">I&#39;m done asking.</p>
<p begin="00:04:15.094" end="00:04:17.993" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Back up. You&#39;re scaring him.</p>
<p begin="00:04:17.417" end="00:04:19.294" style="s2">[crying]</p>
<p begin="00:04:17.993" end="00:04:21.794" style="s2">Get out of that seat.</p>
<p begin="00:04:19.294" end="00:04:26.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Give me a minute.</p>
<p begin="00:04:21.794" end="00:04:26.294" style="s2">What the He&#39;s in my arms.</p>
<p begin="00:04:26.587" end="00:04:29.594" style="s2">[crying]</p>
<p begin="00:04:27.494" end="00:04:33.094" style="s2">Are you deaf? Move.</p>
<p begin="00:04:29.594" end="00:04:33.094" style="s2">Stop, please. Stop.</p>
<p begin="00:04:33.694" end="00:04:36.894" style="s2">God, this is pathetic.</p>
<p begin="00:04:38.994" end="00:04:41.894" style="s2">You&#39;re hurting us.</p>
<p begin="00:04:42.594" end="00:04:45.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chloe, take the baby first.</p>
<p begin="00:04:44.394" end="00:04:47.994" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But she&#39;s saying no.</p>
<p begin="00:04:45.494" end="00:04:47.994" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do it.</p>
<p begin="00:04:51.194" end="00:04:54.194" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t touch my son.</p>
<p begin="00:04:55.394" end="00:04:59.338" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re not paid to think.</p>
<p begin="00:04:56.694" end="00:05:00.194" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m trying, okay?</p>
<p begin="00:04:59.338" end="00:05:01.294" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:05:00.194" end="00:05:03.894" style="s2">Fine.</p>
<p begin="00:05:01.294" end="00:05:06.494" style="s2">I&#39;ll leave. Just don&#39;t take him.</p>
<p begin="00:05:03.894" end="00:05:06.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Finally.</p>
<p begin="00:05:11.783" end="00:05:15.294" style="s2">[crying and laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:05:13.594" end="00:05:17.023" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What the hell did they do?</p>
<p begin="00:05:15.294" end="00:05:17.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did you just hit her?</p>
<p begin="00:05:17.023" end="00:05:19.694" style="s2">[crying]</p>
<p begin="00:05:17.694" end="00:05:21.394" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, this is a private matter.</p>
<p begin="00:05:19.694" end="00:05:22.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A private matter? Her baby was</p>
<p begin="00:05:21.394" end="00:05:24.294" style="s2">screaming.</p>
<p begin="00:05:22.694" end="00:05:25.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t you have somewhere else to be?</p>
<p begin="00:05:24.294" end="00:05:26.794" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah.</p>
<p begin="00:05:25.494" end="00:05:27.694" style="s2">Watching grown adults bully a mother</p>
<p begin="00:05:26.794" end="00:05:29.694" style="s2">wasn&#39;t on my schedule.</p>
<p begin="00:05:27.694" end="00:05:31.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop filming my staff.</p>
<p begin="00:05:29.694" end="00:05:32.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tell me what rule lets you take her</p>
<p begin="00:05:31.094" end="00:05:34.494" style="s2">baby.</p>
<p begin="00:05:32.094" end="00:05:35.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He was going to the nursery.</p>
<p begin="00:05:34.494" end="00:05:37.094" style="s2">Temporarily.</p>
<p begin="00:05:35.494" end="00:05:38.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I told you no.</p>
<p begin="00:05:37.094" end="00:05:41.594" style="s2">Three times.</p>
<p begin="00:05:38.894" end="00:05:42.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did she ever agree?</p>
<p begin="00:05:41.594" end="00:05:42.994" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, but</p>
<p begin="00:05:42.094" end="00:05:45.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chloe.</p>
<p begin="00:05:42.994" end="00:05:45.694" style="s2">Not another word.</p>
<p begin="00:05:46.494" end="00:05:49.794" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mama, are you okay?</p>
<p begin="00:05:48.294" end="00:05:52.194" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I just want to get my son somewhere</p>
<p begin="00:05:49.794" end="00:05:52.194" style="s2">safe.</p>
<p begin="00:05:55.594" end="00:05:59.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you filmed it, keep the original.</p>
<p begin="00:06:00.394" end="00:06:03.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Take it downstairs, now.</p>
<p begin="00:06:02.594" end="00:06:05.495" style="s2">Please.</p>
<p begin="00:06:03.894" end="00:06:09.295" style="s2">Don&#39;t let them say I agreed to this.</p>
<p begin="00:06:05.495" end="00:06:09.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I heard you, and the camera did too.</p>
<p begin="00:06:12.995" end="00:06:15.595" style="s2">What&#39;s your name?</p>
<p begin="00:06:15.695" end="00:06:19.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t film my badge.</p>
<p begin="00:06:17.395" end="00:06:19.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Too late.</p>
<p begin="00:06:25.595" end="00:06:29.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you. That&#39;s all I need.</p>
<p begin="00:06:27.895" end="00:06:31.995" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You, name?</p>
<p begin="00:06:29.695" end="00:06:33.595" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chloe Bennett. Chloe, don&#39;t say anything</p>
<p begin="00:06:31.995" end="00:06:36.995" style="s2">else.</p>
<p begin="00:06:33.595" end="00:06:36.995" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who told you to reach for the baby?</p>
<p begin="00:06:38.244" end="00:06:43.595" style="s2">[crying]</p>
<p begin="00:06:40.195" end="00:06:43.595" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I told you we were helping.</p>
<p begin="00:06:44.095" end="00:06:49.495" style="s2">Helping?</p>
<p begin="00:06:45.895" end="00:06:49.495" style="s2">He couldn&#39;t even breathe from crying.</p>
<p begin="00:06:50.095" end="00:06:54.095" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Two bookings, one suite,</p>
<p begin="00:06:53.095" end="00:06:57.295" style="s2">and she&#39;s the one you hit.</p>
<p begin="00:06:54.095" end="00:07:00.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, off with the camera.</p>
<p begin="00:06:57.295" end="00:07:00.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Keep the whole clip. Don&#39;t trim it.</p>
<p begin="00:07:05.395" end="00:07:11.095" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can still tell them what happened.</p>
<p begin="00:07:08.695" end="00:07:11.095" style="s2">I know.</p>
<p begin="00:07:12.395" end="00:07:15.795" style="s2">We&#39;re finished here.</p>
<p begin="00:07:14.395" end="00:07:18.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You are.</p>
<p begin="00:07:15.795" end="00:07:18.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not.</p>
<p begin="00:07:19.495" end="00:07:23.395" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m backing this up tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:07:22.095" end="00:07:24.995" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:07:23.395" end="00:07:27.895" style="s2">Really.</p>
<p begin="00:07:24.995" end="00:07:30.295" style="s2">Write that she refused to cooperate.</p>
<p begin="00:07:27.895" end="00:07:31.995" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re removing you from the hotel.</p>
<p begin="00:07:30.295" end="00:07:34.095" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I am walking.</p>
<p begin="00:07:31.995" end="00:07:36.695" style="s2">Stop acting like I&#39;m dangerous.</p>
<p begin="00:07:34.095" end="00:07:38.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Should have listened the first time.</p>
<p begin="00:07:36.695" end="00:07:42.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You got my room. Isn&#39;t that enough?</p>
<p begin="00:07:38.695" end="00:07:42.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not until you stop whining.</p>
<p begin="00:07:45.795" end="00:07:49.395" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:07:47.995" end="00:07:51.695" style="s2">I&#39;ve got him.</p>
<p begin="00:07:49.395" end="00:07:51.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right.</p>
<p begin="00:07:52.395" end="00:07:55.595" style="s2">I&#39;ve got the video.</p>
<p begin="00:07:53.895" end="00:07:56.695" style="s2">All of it. [crying]</p>
<p begin="00:07:55.595" end="00:07:59.195" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please don&#39;t lose it.</p>
<p begin="00:07:56.695" end="00:07:59.195" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I won&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:07:59.795" end="00:08:03.395" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can complain through our website.</p>
<p begin="00:08:01.695" end="00:08:06.395" style="s2">After you slap me?</p>
<p begin="00:08:03.395" end="00:08:06.395" style="s2">Oh, I&#39;ll be in touch.</p>
<p begin="00:08:09.195" end="00:08:12.597" style="s2">&gt;&gt; For the record, I&#39;m not leaving because</p>
<p begin="00:08:10.497" end="00:08:16.097" style="s2">I agreed. I&#39;m leaving because I won&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:08:12.597" end="00:08:16.097" style="s2">let them touch my baby again.</p>
<p begin="00:08:28.797" end="00:08:34.697" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I am sorry, baby.</p>
<p begin="00:08:31.497" end="00:08:34.697" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I am so sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:08:38.896" end="00:08:41.697" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ms. Whitfield,</p>
<p begin="00:08:40.396" end="00:08:44.097" style="s2">your refund</p>
<p begin="00:08:41.697" end="00:08:45.397" style="s2">and a free night stay.</p>
<p begin="00:08:44.097" end="00:08:46.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You think I&#39;m coming back?</p>
<p begin="00:08:45.397" end="00:08:48.397" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m sorry. They told me to give it to</p>
<p begin="00:08:46.897" end="00:08:51.397" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:08:48.397" end="00:08:52.797" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;ve done everything we can. You hit me</p>
<p begin="00:08:51.397" end="00:08:54.297" style="s2">three times.</p>
<p begin="00:08:52.797" end="00:08:57.397" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There&#39;s no need to exaggerate.</p>
<p begin="00:08:54.297" end="00:08:59.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exaggerate? Look at my face.</p>
<p begin="00:08:57.397" end="00:09:01.197" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Take the voucher and move on.</p>
<p begin="00:08:59.097" end="00:09:03.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is that supposed to make it okay?</p>
<p begin="00:09:01.197" end="00:09:05.397" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What else do you want?</p>
<p begin="00:09:03.097" end="00:09:09.197" style="s2">&gt;&gt; An actual apology.</p>
<p begin="00:09:05.397" end="00:09:09.197" style="s2">&gt;&gt; For starters, we won&#39;t admit fault.</p>
<p begin="00:09:10.097" end="00:09:13.797" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You know what? We are done talking.</p>
<p begin="00:09:12.397" end="00:09:15.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine. Remember that.</p>
<p begin="00:09:13.797" end="00:09:18.797" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I really am sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:09:15.297" end="00:09:18.797" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then tell the truth when they ask.</p>
<p begin="00:09:22.697" end="00:09:27.597" style="s2">Keep it.</p>
<p begin="00:09:23.997" end="00:09:27.597" style="s2">I do not want anything from you today.</p>
<p begin="00:09:28.897" end="00:09:33.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What could she possibly do? You&#39;ll find</p>
<p begin="00:09:31.097" end="00:09:33.297" style="s2">out.</p>
<p begin="00:09:34.497" end="00:09:39.797" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Finally, peace and quiet.</p>
<p begin="00:09:38.697" end="00:09:42.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Someone was filming.</p>
<p begin="00:09:39.797" end="00:09:44.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So what? Everybody films everything.</p>
<p begin="00:09:42.097" end="00:09:46.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Her face was bruised.</p>
<p begin="00:09:44.497" end="00:09:49.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then tell PR she started it. I don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:09:46.897" end="00:09:49.897" style="s2">need another scandal.</p>
<p begin="00:09:56.497" end="00:10:00.197" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I got the whole thing. No cuts.</p>
<p begin="00:09:58.797" end="00:10:03.397" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Even the baby?</p>
<p begin="00:10:00.197" end="00:10:03.397" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah, that&#39;s the worst part.</p>
<p begin="00:10:05.097" end="00:10:10.397" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh my god, who did this?</p>
<p begin="00:10:06.997" end="00:10:10.397" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The hotel. They tried to take</p>
<p begin="00:10:12.698" end="00:10:15.998" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m calling the police.</p>
<p begin="00:10:14.698" end="00:10:18.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We will.</p>
<p begin="00:10:15.998" end="00:10:18.698" style="s2">Just give me a minute.</p>
<p begin="00:10:27.998" end="00:10:31.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thought you were on holiday.</p>
<p begin="00:10:29.498" end="00:10:33.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah. Plans changed.</p>
<p begin="00:10:31.698" end="00:10:35.098" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jesus, Claire, what happened?</p>
<p begin="00:10:33.298" end="00:10:39.198" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I need the team</p>
<p begin="00:10:35.098" end="00:10:39.198" style="s2">and I need every record they touched.</p>
<p begin="00:10:40.898" end="00:10:43.498" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Which hotel?</p>
