<p begin="00:10:47.598" end="00:10:50.422" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Claire,</p>
<p begin="00:10:48.598" end="00:10:51.898" style="s2">have you slept at all?</p>
<p begin="00:10:50.422" end="00:10:54.398" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
