<p begin="00:11:02.298" end="00:11:06.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, no.</p>
<p begin="00:11:04.798" end="00:11:07.398" style="s2">Please.</p>
<p begin="00:11:06.298" end="00:11:10.998" style="s2">Not yet.</p>
