<p begin="00:11:13.098" end="00:11:16.498" style="s2">I need the evidence first.</p>
<p begin="00:11:24.298" end="00:11:27.198" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did they hurt the baby?</p>
<p begin="00:11:26.398" end="00:11:29.098" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:11:27.198" end="00:11:31.798" style="s2">I didn&#39;t let them.</p>
<p begin="00:11:29.098" end="00:11:33.998" style="s2">But I was so scared, Julia.</p>
<p begin="00:11:31.798" end="00:11:36.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let the firm take this.</p>
<p begin="00:11:33.998" end="00:11:39.698" style="s2">You don&#39;t have to do it alone.</p>
<p begin="00:11:36.698" end="00:11:42.098" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know, but it&#39;s my case.</p>
<p begin="00:11:39.698" end="00:11:45.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They hurt you while you held Oliver.</p>
<p begin="00:11:42.098" end="00:11:45.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly, so I know what they did.</p>
<p begin="00:11:47.898" end="00:11:54.198" style="s2">I won&#39;t call them this morning.</p>
<p begin="00:11:50.198" end="00:11:54.198" style="s2">I need a proper incident timeline first.</p>
<p begin="00:11:54.898" end="00:11:59.398" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then we do this properly.</p>
