<p begin="00:12:16.099" end="00:12:21.699" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You all right, buddy?</p>
<p begin="00:12:18.599" end="00:12:24.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah. I&#39;m fine.</p>
