<p begin="00:12:42.499" end="00:12:45.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thanks, Mum.</p>
<p begin="00:12:49.099" end="00:12:53.399" style="s2">Hey, that&#39;s cheating. You&#39;re bigger. You</p>
