<p begin="00:13:48.899" end="00:13:52.699" style="s2">request.</p>
<p begin="00:13:50.199" end="00:13:55.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly. I want each record tied to a</p>
<p begin="00:13:52.699" end="00:13:55.399" style="s2">timestamp.</p>
<p begin="00:13:55.499" end="00:13:59.799" style="s2">First, a preservation notice,</p>
