<p begin="00:15:30.801" end="00:15:35.101" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly. We check. We don&#39;t guess.</p>
<p begin="00:15:38.801" end="00:15:42.701" style="s2">He&#39;s asleep. Have you eaten?</p>
