<p begin="00:21:08.305" end="00:21:13.505" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And let their version be the only one?</p>
<p begin="00:21:09.805" end="00:21:13.505" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m talking about keeping him safe.</p>
