<p begin="00:21:45.005" end="00:21:50.505" style="s2">You know I do this for a living, right?</p>
<p begin="00:21:47.705" end="00:21:50.505" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then let me be useful.</p>
<p begin="00:21:53.805" end="00:21:57.505" style="s2">Ms. Whitmore, we&#39;d like to settle this</p>
