<p begin="00:22:03.605" end="00:22:08.805" style="s2">and a complimentary future stay.</p>
<p begin="00:22:05.905" end="00:22:11.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A free stay? You&#39;re joking, right?</p>
<p begin="00:22:08.805" end="00:22:13.005" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re trying to make things right.</p>
<p begin="00:22:11.305" end="00:22:14.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your manager hit me.</p>
<p begin="00:22:13.005" end="00:22:18.105" style="s2">Your staff went for my baby.</p>
