<p begin="00:22:39.106" end="00:22:44.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The reporter seems to trust you.</p>
<p begin="00:22:41.306" end="00:22:46.006" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So you want me to clean up your PR mess?</p>
<p begin="00:22:44.306" end="00:22:47.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s a generous offer.</p>
<p begin="00:22:46.006" end="00:22:49.106" style="s2">I&#39;d think carefully.</p>
<p begin="00:22:47.906" end="00:22:49.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have.</p>
<p begin="00:22:49.106" end="00:22:50.506" style="s2">No.</p>
<p begin="00:22:49.906" end="00:22:52.706" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mrs. Whitworth.</p>
