<p begin="00:23:25.306" end="00:23:30.306" style="s2">package</p>
<p begin="00:23:27.306" end="00:23:30.306" style="s2">for showing what they did.</p>
<p begin="00:23:31.206" end="00:23:34.606" style="s2">They called the platform and our ad</p>
<p begin="00:23:33.406" end="00:23:36.406" style="s2">department.</p>
<p begin="00:23:34.606" end="00:23:37.506" style="s2">So it&#39;s not about the law.</p>
<p begin="00:23:36.406" end="00:23:41.106" style="s2">It&#39;s about money.</p>
<p begin="00:23:37.506" end="00:23:43.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m telling you what we&#39;re up against.</p>
