<p begin="00:23:43.306" end="00:23:45.406" style="s2">two backups.</p>
<p begin="00:23:44.306" end="00:23:46.806" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know.</p>
<p begin="00:23:45.406" end="00:23:48.206" style="s2">But they can make this expensive.</p>
<p begin="00:23:46.806" end="00:23:50.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If I take it down, I&#39;m helping them bury</p>
