<p begin="00:24:32.507" end="00:24:37.107" style="s2">We have enough to start. Are you sure?</p>
<p begin="00:24:35.207" end="00:24:38.707" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They had a chance to fix it.</p>
<p begin="00:24:37.107" end="00:24:40.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They offered 25 grand.</p>
<p begin="00:24:38.707" end="00:24:44.007" style="s2">&gt;&gt; To shut me up.</p>
<p begin="00:24:40.307" end="00:24:44.007" style="s2">And now they want Noah quiet, too.</p>
<p begin="00:24:45.707" end="00:24:49.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Once this goes out, they&#39;ll know you&#39;re</p>
