<p begin="00:24:49.107" end="00:24:52.707" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good.</p>
<p begin="00:24:50.207" end="00:24:52.707" style="s2">Send it.</p>
<p begin="00:24:56.707" end="00:24:59.607" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s it then?</p>
<p begin="00:24:58.107" end="00:25:02.907" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:24:59.607" end="00:25:02.907" style="s2">This is where it starts.</p>
<p begin="00:25:05.107" end="00:25:10.007" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Legal papers for the Whitmore incident.</p>
<p begin="00:25:07.207" end="00:25:10.007" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Another complaint?</p>
<p begin="00:25:16.907" end="00:25:20.207" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nervous?</p>
<p begin="00:25:18.007" end="00:25:22.907" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A bit. Mostly angry.</p>
<p begin="00:25:20.207" end="00:25:24.207" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s allowed.</p>
