<p begin="00:25:49.807" end="00:25:52.307" style="s2">on video.</p>
<p begin="00:25:57.307" end="00:26:00.307" style="s2"></p>
<p begin="00:25:59.107" end="00:26:02.607" style="s2">Does Vivian know?</p>
<p begin="00:26:00.307" end="00:26:04.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t think anyone on site knew.</p>
<p begin="00:26:02.607" end="00:26:05.907" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Call our lawyers.</p>
<p begin="00:26:04.507" end="00:26:07.907" style="s2">And call the Ashcrofts.</p>
<p begin="00:26:05.907" end="00:26:09.807" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please tell me this is over.</p>
<p begin="00:26:07.907" end="00:26:11.207" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The woman you threw out, she&#39;s a top</p>
<p begin="00:26:09.807" end="00:26:13.607" style="s2">litigation lawyer.</p>
<p begin="00:26:11.207" end="00:26:14.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So, my father has lawyers, too. Let her</p>
<p begin="00:26:13.607" end="00:26:16.507" style="s2">try.</p>
<p begin="00:26:14.107" end="00:26:19.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She filed against the hotel</p>
<p begin="00:26:16.507" end="00:26:19.307" style="s2">with evidence.</p>
<p begin="00:26:22.207" end="00:26:26.507" style="s2">Who cleared this report?</p>
