<p begin="00:27:06.509" end="00:27:10.109" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We got three calls this morning.</p>
<p begin="00:27:08.809" end="00:27:11.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; About my story?</p>
<p begin="00:27:10.109" end="00:27:13.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One advertiser wants its campaign</p>
<p begin="00:27:11.709" end="00:27:14.809" style="s2">paused.</p>
<p begin="00:27:13.309" end="00:27:15.909" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did they say the video was fake?</p>
<p begin="00:27:14.809" end="00:27:18.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:27:15.909" end="00:27:20.309" style="s2">They want you to stop posting.</p>
<p begin="00:27:18.709" end="00:27:22.409" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So the truth&#39;s fine</p>
<p begin="00:27:20.309" end="00:27:24.809" style="s2">as long as nobody sees it.</p>
<p begin="00:27:22.409" end="00:27:28.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve got people here who need paying.</p>
<p begin="00:27:24.809" end="00:27:28.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And she had a baby in her arms.</p>
<p begin="00:27:29.309" end="00:27:32.409" style="s2">Don&#39;t promise them anything.</p>
<p begin="00:27:30.709" end="00:27:33.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not promising.</p>
<p begin="00:27:32.409" end="00:27:37.309" style="s2">I&#39;m counting.</p>
<p begin="00:27:33.709" end="00:27:37.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And I&#39;m telling you what I saw.</p>
<p begin="00:27:45.409" end="00:27:49.609" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They want an answer by tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:27:47.509" end="00:27:50.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Take the story down and the contract</p>
<p begin="00:27:49.609" end="00:27:52.109" style="s2">stays.</p>
<p begin="00:27:50.509" end="00:27:53.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re asking us to kill verified</p>
<p begin="00:27:52.109" end="00:27:56.109" style="s2">reporting.</p>
<p begin="00:27:53.309" end="00:27:59.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m offering a business solution.</p>
<p begin="00:27:56.109" end="00:27:59.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Call it what it is, a threat.</p>
<p begin="00:27:59.909" end="00:28:03.509" style="s2">How much are we talking about?</p>
<p begin="00:28:01.309" end="00:28:06.009" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Half a million in advertising. Your</p>
<p begin="00:28:03.509" end="00:28:08.109" style="s2">choice.</p>
<p begin="00:28:06.009" end="00:28:09.809" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So a slap&#39;s worth half a million now?</p>
<p begin="00:28:08.109" end="00:28:11.809" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This isn&#39;t personal.</p>
<p begin="00:28:09.809" end="00:28:13.009" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It was pretty personal for that mother.</p>
<p begin="00:28:11.809" end="00:28:16.009" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Give me until tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:28:13.009" end="00:28:19.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No more posts in the meantime.</p>
<p begin="00:28:16.009" end="00:28:19.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re not really considering this.</p>
<p begin="00:28:19.509" end="00:28:23.009" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have 40 people working here.</p>
<p begin="00:28:21.809" end="00:28:25.409" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And if the next client doesn&#39;t like the</p>
<p begin="00:28:23.009" end="00:28:25.409" style="s2">truth?</p>
<p begin="00:28:26.209" end="00:28:30.209" style="s2">Look at me. Did I fake anything?</p>
<p begin="00:28:28.509" end="00:28:33.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:28:30.209" end="00:28:33.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then don&#39;t make me act like I did.</p>
<p begin="00:28:35.109" end="00:28:38.210" style="s2">She wasn&#39;t asking for a favor.</p>
<p begin="00:28:37.310" end="00:28:39.510" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know. [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:28:38.210" end="00:28:42.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then why are we acting like the rich guy</p>
<p begin="00:28:39.510" end="00:28:42.310" style="s2">gets the final word?</p>
<p begin="00:28:48.710" end="00:28:51.410" style="s2">They pulled the money?</p>
<p begin="00:28:53.510" end="00:28:57.810" style="s2">Because of my video?</p>
<p begin="00:28:54.410" end="00:28:57.810" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because you won&#39;t stop posting.</p>
<p begin="00:28:58.910" end="00:29:01.710" style="s2">40 people get paid from this place,</p>
<p begin="00:29:01.210" end="00:29:04.010" style="s2">Noah.</p>
<p begin="00:29:01.710" end="00:29:06.510" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And one mom got slapped holding her</p>
<p begin="00:29:04.010" end="00:29:06.510" style="s2">baby.</p>
<p begin="00:29:07.110" end="00:29:10.110" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re off the story</p>
<p begin="00:29:08.510" end="00:29:11.110" style="s2">for now.</p>
<p begin="00:29:10.110" end="00:29:13.410" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can&#39;t be serious.</p>
<p begin="00:29:11.110" end="00:29:17.110" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The original stays up,</p>
<p begin="00:29:13.410" end="00:29:17.110" style="s2">but no more follow-ups under our name.</p>
<p begin="00:29:20.410" end="00:29:25.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can take the assignment.</p>
<p begin="00:29:22.310" end="00:29:25.310" style="s2">You don&#39;t own what I saw.</p>
<p begin="00:30:00.610" end="00:30:05.010" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who printed that email? Was it you?</p>
<p begin="00:30:04.010" end="00:30:07.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:30:05.010" end="00:30:07.710" style="s2">And I&#39;m not sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:30:09.410" end="00:30:11.910" style="s2">I had they pulled you off the story.</p>
<p begin="00:30:11.110" end="00:30:15.410" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah.</p>
<p begin="00:30:11.910" end="00:30:15.410" style="s2">Apparently truth&#39;s bad for business.</p>
<p begin="00:30:15.610" end="00:30:19.510" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t publish that email yet. We need to</p>
<p begin="00:30:17.710" end="00:30:20.910" style="s2">verify where it came from.</p>
<p begin="00:30:19.510" end="00:30:23.910" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know.</p>
<p begin="00:30:20.910" end="00:30:23.910" style="s2">I didn&#39;t come here to play hero.</p>
<p begin="00:30:34.610" end="00:30:38.312" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So the hotel isn&#39;t acting alone?</p>
<p begin="00:30:36.712" end="00:30:39.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Looks that way.</p>
<p begin="00:30:38.312" end="00:30:41.712" style="s2">We still need proof of who gave the</p>
<p begin="00:30:39.712" end="00:30:43.111" style="s2">order. I have the uncut clip and the</p>
<p begin="00:30:41.712" end="00:30:46.911" style="s2">upload history.</p>
<p begin="00:30:43.111" end="00:30:46.911" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good. Keep your originals.</p>
<p begin="00:30:49.411" end="00:30:52.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t owe me anything.</p>
<p begin="00:30:51.111" end="00:30:54.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Neither do you.</p>
<p begin="00:30:52.712" end="00:30:55.812" style="s2">You could walk away.</p>
<p begin="00:30:54.712" end="00:30:58.611" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah.</p>
<p begin="00:30:55.812" end="00:30:58.611" style="s2">That&#39;s what scares them.</p>
<p begin="00:31:00.111" end="00:31:03.911" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They want the reporter and the</p>
<p begin="00:31:01.111" end="00:31:03.911" style="s2">settlement now.</p>
<p begin="00:31:13.611" end="00:31:16.411" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then we&#39;re getting close.</p>
<p begin="00:31:18.911" end="00:31:23.511" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My judgment?</p>
<p begin="00:31:20.712" end="00:31:23.511" style="s2">You&#39;ve got to be kidding me.</p>
<p begin="00:31:25.312" end="00:31:31.411" style="s2">We need to stick to the report.</p>
<p begin="00:31:27.712" end="00:31:32.911" style="s2">It says I decided to take the baby.</p>
<p begin="00:31:31.411" end="00:31:36.511" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You were the one who reached for him.</p>
<p begin="00:31:32.911" end="00:31:36.511" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because you told me to.</p>
<p begin="00:31:39.911" end="00:31:42.312" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lower your voice.</p>
<p begin="00:31:41.111" end="00:31:45.812" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:31:42.312" end="00:31:47.611" style="s2">You said take the baby first, twice.</p>
<p begin="00:31:45.812" end="00:31:48.911" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I told you to help the guest.</p>
<p begin="00:31:47.611" end="00:31:52.712" style="s2"></p>
<p begin="00:31:48.911" end="00:31:52.712" style="s2">She was begging us to leave him alone.</p>
<p begin="00:31:58.712" end="00:32:03.611" style="s2">You wrote that down?</p>
<p begin="00:32:01.011" end="00:32:07.111" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was scared I&#39;d get blamed.</p>
<p begin="00:32:03.611" end="00:32:10.712" style="s2">If this gets out, we both lose our jobs.</p>
<p begin="00:32:07.111" end="00:32:10.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m already losing mine in your version.</p>
<p begin="00:32:27.312" end="00:32:32.011" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s new.</p>
<p begin="00:32:28.812" end="00:32:32.011" style="s2">Why change the wording now?</p>
<p begin="00:32:36.611" end="00:32:39.713" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because someone&#39;s about to talk.</p>
<p begin="00:32:40.413" end="00:32:43.413" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The story&#39;s dying down.</p>
<p begin="00:32:41.613" end="00:32:45.213" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good. Keep it that way.</p>
<p begin="00:32:43.413" end="00:32:48.113" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Except Chloe&#39;s asking for the original</p>
<p begin="00:32:45.213" end="00:32:48.113" style="s2">incident report.</p>
<p begin="00:32:50.113" end="00:32:54.713" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why?</p>
<p begin="00:32:51.413" end="00:32:54.713" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because the new statement blames her.</p>
<p begin="00:32:55.813" end="00:32:59.113" style="s2">You&#39;ve read it? Sign it, please.</p>
<p begin="00:32:59.313" end="00:33:02.613" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This isn&#39;t what I said.</p>
<p begin="00:33:01.213" end="00:33:05.713" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Legal approved it.</p>
<p begin="00:33:02.613" end="00:33:05.713" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then legal can sign it.</p>
<p begin="00:33:16.913" end="00:33:19.413" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Vivian.</p>
<p begin="00:33:20.213" end="00:33:24.913" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We don&#39;t know.</p>
<p begin="00:33:21.313" end="00:33:24.913" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Find out quietly.</p>
<p begin="00:33:26.113" end="00:33:31.613" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So I get my byline,</p>
<p begin="00:33:28.713" end="00:33:31.613" style="s2">but not my voice.</p>
<p begin="00:33:34.013" end="00:33:36.513" style="s2">Martin, did you even read the new</p>
<p begin="00:33:35.613" end="00:33:38.813" style="s2">statement?</p>
<p begin="00:33:36.513" end="00:33:42.113" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I did. It changes the story.</p>
<p begin="00:33:38.813" end="00:33:45.913" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. It changes who they blame.</p>
<p begin="00:33:42.113" end="00:33:48.213" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bring me proof, not anger.</p>
<p begin="00:33:45.913" end="00:33:48.213" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Deal.</p>
<p begin="00:33:58.713" end="00:34:03.613" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Bennett?</p>
<p begin="00:33:59.913" end="00:34:03.613" style="s2">I&#39;m calling from the mediation team.</p>
<p begin="00:34:04.213" end="00:34:07.713" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Am I in trouble?</p>
<p begin="00:34:05.513" end="00:34:09.913" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We need your own account in your own</p>
<p begin="00:34:07.713" end="00:34:11.212" style="s2">words.</p>
<p begin="00:34:09.913" end="00:34:13.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can I have a lawyer?</p>
<p begin="00:34:11.212" end="00:34:13.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course.</p>
<p begin="00:34:24.313" end="00:34:26.813" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who made the decision to approach the</p>
<p begin="00:34:25.613" end="00:34:28.313" style="s2">child?</p>
<p begin="00:34:26.813" end="00:34:30.413" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chloe was trying to help.</p>
<p begin="00:34:28.313" end="00:34:32.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s not what I asked.</p>
<p begin="00:34:30.413" end="00:34:35.212" style="s2">Operations wanted the suite cleared, and</p>
<p begin="00:34:32.313" end="00:34:38.212" style="s2">who [music] told Chloe to take the baby?</p>
<p begin="00:34:35.212" end="00:34:38.212" style="s2">We were all under pressure.</p>
<p begin="00:34:51.513" end="00:34:54.714" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;ll say it was a misunderstanding.</p>
<p begin="00:34:53.414" end="00:34:55.714" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then I&#39;ll ask why nobody stopped when I</p>
<p begin="00:34:54.714" end="00:34:57.314" style="s2">said no.</p>
<p begin="00:34:55.714" end="00:35:00.614" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And if they blame Chloe?</p>
<p begin="00:34:57.314" end="00:35:00.614" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We ask who she was listening to.</p>
<p begin="00:35:05.194" end="00:35:09.414" style="s2">[sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:35:07.214" end="00:35:12.414" style="s2">I don&#39;t need a perfect speech.</p>
<p begin="00:35:09.414" end="00:35:12.414" style="s2">I need the truth.</p>
<p begin="00:35:19.414" end="00:35:22.314" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I watched it again, all of it.</p>
<p begin="00:35:21.314" end="00:35:24.614" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And?</p>
<p begin="00:35:22.314" end="00:35:26.614" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We keep the story up. You&#39;re back on it.</p>
<p begin="00:35:24.614" end="00:35:28.114" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What about the money?</p>
<p begin="00:35:26.614" end="00:35:30.614" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We deal with it. We don&#39;t sell the</p>
<p begin="00:35:28.114" end="00:35:30.614" style="s2">truth.</p>
<p begin="00:35:31.614" end="00:35:35.614" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Every time Stamp checks out.</p>
<p begin="00:35:34.014" end="00:35:38.114" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then let&#39;s show what they cut out.</p>
<p begin="00:35:35.614" end="00:35:39.314" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Slow down. Legal checks every word</p>
<p begin="00:35:38.114" end="00:35:41.614" style="s2">first.</p>
<p begin="00:35:39.314" end="00:35:41.614" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fair.</p>
<p begin="00:35:42.214" end="00:35:46.714" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They chose the story over the contract</p>
<p begin="00:35:44.714" end="00:35:48.814" style="s2">and the reporter&#39;s back.</p>
<p begin="00:35:46.714" end="00:35:51.914" style="s2"></p>
<p begin="00:35:48.814" end="00:35:51.914" style="s2">Get me Dana.</p>
<p begin="00:35:58.314" end="00:36:03.514" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One bad fact and they&#39;ll tear us apart.</p>
<p begin="00:36:00.514" end="00:36:03.514" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then we don&#39;t give them one.</p>
<p begin="00:36:06.414" end="00:36:08.814" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We haven&#39;t even fixed the staff</p>
<p begin="00:36:07.614" end="00:36:12.014" style="s2">statements.</p>
<p begin="00:36:08.814" end="00:36:12.014" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Chloe refused to sign.</p>
<p begin="00:36:14.114" end="00:36:18.714" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bring them in.</p>
<p begin="00:36:16.414" end="00:36:20.014" style="s2">All of them. Mediation&#39;s been accepted.</p>
<p begin="00:36:18.714" end="00:36:22.514" style="s2">We need one version.</p>
<p begin="00:36:20.014" end="00:36:25.014" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One version or the truth. Don&#39;t start,</p>
<p begin="00:36:22.514" end="00:36:25.014" style="s2">Chloe.</p>
<p begin="00:36:25.114" end="00:36:28.414" style="s2">Read the part about the child.</p>
<p begin="00:36:29.035" end="00:36:31.055" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:36:31.214" end="00:36:35.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t volunteer. She told me to do</p>
<p begin="00:36:32.814" end="00:36:38.014" style="s2">it. I said help the guest. You said take</p>
<p begin="00:36:35.914" end="00:36:40.514" style="s2">the baby first.</p>
<p begin="00:36:38.014" end="00:36:42.814" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enough. We don&#39;t need a fight on record.</p>
<p begin="00:36:40.514" end="00:36:44.614" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then don&#39;t write a lie. Video beats a</p>
<p begin="00:36:42.814" end="00:36:46.216" style="s2">script.</p>
<p begin="00:36:44.614" end="00:36:47.816" style="s2">So I&#39;m on my own now.</p>
<p begin="00:36:46.216" end="00:36:48.916" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You ran that floor.</p>
<p begin="00:36:47.816" end="00:36:49.916" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And who kept calling about the</p>
<p begin="00:36:48.916" end="00:36:52.670" style="s2">reception?</p>
<p begin="00:36:49.916" end="00:36:52.670" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Careful. [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:36:55.416" end="00:37:00.115" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who changed this line?</p>
<p begin="00:36:56.716" end="00:37:00.115" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The system logs every edit.</p>
<p begin="00:37:04.615" end="00:37:08.416" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not signing something that isn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:37:06.115" end="00:37:08.416" style="s2">true.</p>
<p begin="00:37:11.316" end="00:37:15.216" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They keep saying you wouldn&#39;t cooperate.</p>
<p begin="00:37:13.716" end="00:37:16.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I wouldn&#39;t hand over my baby, damn</p>
<p begin="00:37:15.216" end="00:37:17.615" style="s2">right.</p>
<p begin="00:37:16.516" end="00:37:19.416" style="s2">They&#39;ll try to make you angry at</p>
<p begin="00:37:17.615" end="00:37:20.780" style="s2">mediation. They don&#39;t have to try very</p>
<p begin="00:37:19.416" end="00:37:22.800" style="s2">hard.</p>
<p begin="00:37:20.780" end="00:37:22.800" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:37:34.516" end="00:37:38.816" style="s2">We asked Chloe what she heard, then</p>
<p begin="00:37:36.516" end="00:37:40.716" style="s2">Victoria who was pushing her.</p>
<p begin="00:37:38.816" end="00:37:44.216" style="s2">And if say it was chaos, then why was</p>
<p begin="00:37:40.716" end="00:37:44.216" style="s2">the order so damn clear?</p>
<p begin="00:37:49.615" end="00:37:52.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You want me to lead the questioning?</p>
<p begin="00:37:51.316" end="00:37:54.916" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll speak when they start talking about</p>
<p begin="00:37:52.516" end="00:37:54.916" style="s2">my son.</p>
<p begin="00:37:59.716" end="00:38:02.516" style="s2">No dramatic edits. Let them hear the</p>
<p begin="00:38:01.316" end="00:38:05.115" style="s2">whole thing.</p>
<p begin="00:38:02.516" end="00:38:05.115" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Already done.</p>
<p begin="00:38:06.916" end="00:38:12.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They heard me say no.</p>
<p begin="00:38:09.316" end="00:38:12.516" style="s2">That&#39;s what I need them to admit.</p>
<p begin="00:38:16.316" end="00:38:18.115" style="s2">You didn&#39;t have to make a scene</p>
<p begin="00:38:17.115" end="00:38:19.615" style="s2">yesterday.</p>
<p begin="00:38:18.115" end="00:38:21.916" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You put my name on a lie.</p>
<p begin="00:38:19.615" end="00:38:25.016" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s a statement, not a confession.</p>
<p begin="00:38:21.916" end="00:38:25.016" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then sign it yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:38:25.316" end="00:38:28.516" style="s2">Do you know how hard I worked to get</p>
<p begin="00:38:27.016" end="00:38:30.316" style="s2">that job?</p>
<p begin="00:38:28.516" end="00:38:32.716" style="s2">And I might lose mine because I listened</p>
<p begin="00:38:30.316" end="00:38:32.716" style="s2">to you.</p>
<p begin="00:38:35.816" end="00:38:39.316" style="s2">You told me to take him.</p>
<p begin="00:38:38.416" end="00:38:41.016" style="s2">I wrote it down.</p>
<p begin="00:38:39.316" end="00:38:42.216" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You were supposed to keep that private.</p>
<p begin="00:38:41.016" end="00:38:45.115" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I kept it</p>
<p begin="00:38:42.216" end="00:38:45.115" style="s2">because I was scared.</p>
<p begin="00:38:46.916" end="00:38:50.317" style="s2">I&#39;ll tell them what I remember. That&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:38:48.217" end="00:38:50.317" style="s2">it.</p>
<p begin="00:38:53.517" end="00:38:55.917" style="s2">Just tell me the old roster still</p>
<p begin="00:38:54.817" end="00:38:59.317" style="s2">exists.</p>
<p begin="00:38:55.917" end="00:38:59.317" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It should. I can check.</p>
<p begin="00:39:03.817" end="00:39:08.317" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You want me to take the fall?</p>
<p begin="00:39:05.517" end="00:39:10.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I want you to own your decision.</p>
<p begin="00:39:08.317" end="00:39:10.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And yours?</p>
<p begin="00:39:13.017" end="00:39:16.017" style="s2">I&#39;m not signing this.</p>
<p begin="00:39:17.717" end="00:39:20.117" style="s2">Where&#39;s Richard Vale?</p>
<p begin="00:39:18.917" end="00:39:21.017" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not listed. They&#39;re sending a corporate</p>
<p begin="00:39:20.117" end="00:39:23.817" style="s2">representative.</p>
<p begin="00:39:21.017" end="00:39:23.817" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course they are.</p>
<p begin="00:39:25.217" end="00:39:30.317" style="s2">They&#39;re blaming the reception schedule.</p>
<p begin="00:39:28.017" end="00:39:31.917" style="s2">Then who&#39;s in charge of operations?</p>
<p begin="00:39:30.317" end="00:39:33.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Richard.</p>
<p begin="00:39:31.917" end="00:39:36.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And somehow he&#39;s the only one</p>
<p begin="00:39:33.917" end="00:39:36.917" style="s2">who doesn&#39;t have to show up.</p>
<p begin="00:39:37.617" end="00:39:41.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They can speak for the company.</p>
<p begin="00:39:41.317" end="00:39:44.817" style="s2">Not for everyone&#39;s memory.</p>
<p begin="00:39:43.517" end="00:39:47.717" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine.</p>
<p begin="00:39:44.817" end="00:39:47.717" style="s2">Put that in the record.</p>
<p begin="00:39:48.517" end="00:39:53.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You think they&#39;ll answer?</p>
<p begin="00:39:49.617" end="00:39:53.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;ll have to explain why they can&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:40:06.497" end="00:40:08.517" style="s2">[panting]</p>
<p begin="00:40:10.417" end="00:40:13.717" style="s2">She&#39;s not rehearsing the story anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:40:12.317" end="00:40:15.217" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then keep her out of the room.</p>
<p begin="00:40:13.717" end="00:40:17.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s already named in the video.</p>
<p begin="00:40:15.217" end="00:40:17.917" style="s2">That&#39;ll look worse.</p>
<p begin="00:40:25.817" end="00:40:30.217" style="s2">Then make damn sure Victoria knows what</p>
<p begin="00:40:27.817" end="00:40:30.217" style="s2">to say.</p>
<p begin="00:40:30.617" end="00:40:33.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just stick to what we agreed.</p>
<p begin="00:40:31.817" end="00:40:35.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We didn&#39;t agree.</p>
<p begin="00:40:33.117" end="00:40:35.617" style="s2">You wrote it.</p>
<p begin="00:40:36.117" end="00:40:40.717" style="s2">This isn&#39;t a rehearsal.</p>
<p begin="00:40:38.817" end="00:40:41.817" style="s2">I need what each of you remembers.</p>
<p begin="00:40:40.717" end="00:40:43.217" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine.</p>
<p begin="00:40:41.817" end="00:40:44.517" style="s2">She was helping move the guest.</p>
<p begin="00:40:43.217" end="00:40:48.317" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:40:44.517" end="00:40:48.317" style="s2">You told me to take the baby first.</p>
<p begin="00:40:51.017" end="00:40:53.518" style="s2">The family tailor is tense then than I</p>
<p begin="00:40:52.518" end="00:40:55.318" style="s2">most adapt now.</p>
<p begin="00:40:53.518" end="00:40:58.218" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That note proves nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:40:55.318" end="00:41:00.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then why are you so scared of it?</p>
<p begin="00:40:58.218" end="00:41:03.718" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I could lose my job over this.</p>
<p begin="00:41:00.318" end="00:41:03.718" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And you think I won&#39;t?</p>
<p begin="00:41:08.218" end="00:41:11.218" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Alone, Victoria.</p>
<p begin="00:41:21.318" end="00:41:26.618" style="s2">Who gave the instruction?</p>
<p begin="00:41:23.918" end="00:41:26.618" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Victoria did.</p>
<p begin="00:41:28.318" end="00:41:30.918" style="s2">I don&#39;t want another statement with my</p>
<p begin="00:41:29.618" end="00:41:32.118" style="s2">name on it</p>
<p begin="00:41:30.918" end="00:41:35.918" style="s2">that I never saw.</p>
<p begin="00:41:32.118" end="00:41:35.918" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You won&#39;t. I&#39;ll log this request.</p>
<p begin="00:41:37.018" end="00:41:39.418" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;ve raised the money.</p>
<p begin="00:41:38.318" end="00:41:42.518" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How much?</p>
<p begin="00:41:39.418" end="00:41:42.518" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enough to make it tempting.</p>
<p begin="00:41:43.418" end="00:41:48.218" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who&#39;s getting released?</p>
<p begin="00:41:44.718" end="00:41:49.718" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The hotel, the staff, management,</p>
<p begin="00:41:48.218" end="00:41:52.118" style="s2">everyone.</p>
<p begin="00:41:49.718" end="00:41:54.518" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There it is.</p>
<p begin="00:41:52.118" end="00:41:56.118" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get her signature</p>
<p begin="00:41:54.518" end="00:41:58.818" style="s2">before Chloe gives that account to</p>
<p begin="00:41:56.118" end="00:41:58.818" style="s2">mediation.</p>
<p begin="00:41:59.218" end="00:42:03.018" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She has her own lawyers.</p>
<p begin="00:42:01.318" end="00:42:06.118" style="s2">She&#39;ll read every line.</p>
<p begin="00:42:03.018" end="00:42:06.118" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then make the number bigger.</p>
<p begin="00:42:07.518" end="00:42:10.518" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They want me to forget who gave the</p>
<p begin="00:42:08.918" end="00:42:12.218" style="s2">orders.</p>
<p begin="00:42:10.518" end="00:42:14.818" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We can counter with separate</p>
<p begin="00:42:12.218" end="00:42:16.718" style="s2">accountability terms.</p>
<p begin="00:42:14.818" end="00:42:20.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do it.</p>
<p begin="00:42:16.718" end="00:42:20.318" style="s2">But don&#39;t trade the facts for cash.</p>
<p begin="00:42:26.518" end="00:42:31.018" style="s2">I don&#39;t need them to love me. I need the</p>
<p begin="00:42:28.118" end="00:42:31.018" style="s2">record straight.</p>
<p begin="00:42:42.418" end="00:42:46.818" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;ve included people</p>
<p begin="00:42:44.618" end="00:42:48.018" style="s2">who weren&#39;t even in the room.</p>
<p begin="00:42:46.818" end="00:42:50.618" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s why I want their names on the</p>
<p begin="00:42:48.018" end="00:42:50.618" style="s2">record.</p>
<p begin="00:42:54.320" end="00:42:59.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s not settling.</p>
<p begin="00:42:56.320" end="00:42:59.520" style="s2">Find someone to blame.</p>
<p begin="00:43:00.220" end="00:43:05.920" style="s2">Sign it. We can put this behind us.</p>
<p begin="00:43:03.720" end="00:43:07.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Independent decision?</p>
<p begin="00:43:05.920" end="00:43:09.720" style="s2">You called me three times.</p>
<p begin="00:43:07.920" end="00:43:11.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I asked you to clear the suite</p>
<p begin="00:43:09.720" end="00:43:13.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; for the Ashcroft</p>
<p begin="00:43:11.720" end="00:43:16.020" style="s2">before their reception.</p>
<p begin="00:43:13.720" end="00:43:18.720" style="s2">Let&#39;s not confuse pressure with an order</p>
<p begin="00:43:16.020" end="00:43:21.920" style="s2">to touch the child.</p>
<p begin="00:43:18.720" end="00:43:21.920" style="s2">I&#39;m not saying he said that.</p>
<p begin="00:43:26.620" end="00:43:29.820" style="s2">You want me to carry the whole thing?</p>
<p begin="00:43:28.320" end="00:43:32.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You were the manager.</p>
<p begin="00:43:29.820" end="00:43:34.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And you were running operations.</p>
<p begin="00:43:32.920" end="00:43:38.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re running out of time.</p>
<p begin="00:43:34.320" end="00:43:38.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s not a reason to change the facts.</p>
<p begin="00:43:43.420" end="00:43:48.920" style="s2">I&#39;ll answer for what I did,</p>
<p begin="00:43:45.820" end="00:43:48.920" style="s2">not for what you did.</p>
<p begin="00:43:52.420" end="00:43:55.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can we dismiss her?</p>
<p begin="00:43:53.720" end="00:43:58.620" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can.</p>
<p begin="00:43:55.320" end="00:43:58.620" style="s2">You can&#39;t erase the calls.</p>
<p begin="00:44:00.620" end="00:44:06.220" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can we at least keep this internal?</p>
<p begin="00:44:02.420" end="00:44:06.220" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not if mediation asks for the records.</p>
<p begin="00:44:13.520" end="00:44:16.820" style="s2">I&#39;m telling them everything.</p>
<p begin="00:44:20.220" end="00:44:22.920" style="s2">Where&#39;s Vale?</p>
<p begin="00:44:21.320" end="00:44:25.020" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Corporate representative only. He&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:44:22.920" end="00:44:27.320" style="s2">staying out.</p>
<p begin="00:44:25.020" end="00:44:28.820" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course he is.</p>
<p begin="00:44:27.320" end="00:44:31.920" style="s2">They&#39;ll say nobody meant to hurt you.</p>
<p begin="00:44:28.820" end="00:44:31.920" style="s2">Then why did nobody stop?</p>
<p begin="00:44:35.220" end="00:44:37.620" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let me ask the first questions.</p>
<p begin="00:44:36.520" end="00:44:41.220" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine.</p>
<p begin="00:44:37.620" end="00:44:41.220" style="s2">When they get to my son, I speak.</p>
<p begin="00:44:45.220" end="00:44:48.720" style="s2">You don&#39;t have to prove you&#39;re tough. I</p>
<p begin="00:44:47.320" end="00:44:52.320" style="s2">know.</p>
<p begin="00:44:48.720" end="00:44:52.320" style="s2">I just need them to say what happened.</p>
<p begin="00:45:00.021" end="00:45:03.721" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Both are coming.</p>
<p begin="00:45:02.321" end="00:45:07.521" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good.</p>
<p begin="00:45:03.721" end="00:45:07.521" style="s2">Nobody answers for anyone else.</p>
<p begin="00:45:14.221" end="00:45:17.321" style="s2">Will you be okay in that room?</p>
<p begin="00:45:18.921" end="00:45:22.121" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ask me after it&#39;s over.</p>
<p begin="00:45:27.221" end="00:45:33.521" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If they dodge, we record that, too.</p>
<p begin="00:45:29.721" end="00:45:33.521" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good. No shouting match.</p>
<p begin="00:45:36.521" end="00:45:40.121" style="s2">That&#39;s convenient.</p>
<p begin="00:45:38.521" end="00:45:41.921" style="s2">Both of us.</p>
<p begin="00:45:40.121" end="00:45:43.921" style="s2">Just like that.</p>
<p begin="00:45:41.921" end="00:45:45.421" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The board&#39;s independent review is still</p>
<p begin="00:45:43.921" end="00:45:47.021" style="s2">ongoing.</p>
<p begin="00:45:45.421" end="00:45:49.221" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What about operations?</p>
<p begin="00:45:47.021" end="00:45:50.621" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re reviewing all departments.</p>
<p begin="00:45:49.221" end="00:45:54.021" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Funny.</p>
<p begin="00:45:50.621" end="00:45:54.021" style="s2">This paper only names us.</p>
<p begin="00:45:56.421" end="00:46:00.721" style="s2">I wasn&#39;t acting alone.</p>
<p begin="00:45:58.121" end="00:46:00.721" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Neither was I.</p>
<p begin="00:46:01.521" end="00:46:05.121" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then give the investigator what you</p>
<p begin="00:46:02.821" end="00:46:05.121" style="s2">have.</p>
<p begin="00:46:08.021" end="00:46:10.121" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;re trying to end the story at the</p>
<p begin="00:46:09.121" end="00:46:11.521" style="s2">front desk.</p>
<p begin="00:46:10.121" end="00:46:14.121" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But the room wasn&#39;t reassigned by the</p>
<p begin="00:46:11.521" end="00:46:14.121" style="s2">front desk.</p>
<p begin="00:46:16.421" end="00:46:21.021" style="s2">Someone changed the booking.</p>
<p begin="00:46:19.021" end="00:46:23.121" style="s2">Someone pushed the deadline.</p>
<p begin="00:46:21.021" end="00:46:24.521" style="s2">Someone wrote that press statement.</p>
<p begin="00:46:23.121" end="00:46:25.221" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And now they&#39;re calling it two bad</p>
<p begin="00:46:24.521" end="00:46:28.621" style="s2">employees.</p>
<p begin="00:46:25.221" end="00:46:28.621" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let them say that in mediation.</p>
<p begin="00:46:34.221" end="00:46:37.321" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve got to be kidding me.</p>
<p begin="00:46:47.221" end="00:46:50.821" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I want every version,</p>
<p begin="00:46:48.621" end="00:46:54.621" style="s2">not the cleaned-up one.</p>
<p begin="00:46:50.821" end="00:46:54.621" style="s2">&gt;&gt; First question, who was giving the</p>
<p begin="00:46:54.721" end="00:46:57.822" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s start with the booking.</p>
<p begin="00:46:56.522" end="00:46:59.822" style="s2">Two guests,</p>
<p begin="00:46:57.822" end="00:47:01.122" style="s2">same suite, both confirmed?</p>
<p begin="00:46:59.822" end="00:47:02.622" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:47:01.122" end="00:47:04.722" style="s2">There was a system error.</p>
<p begin="00:47:02.622" end="00:47:06.822" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And you asked only me to leave?</p>
<p begin="00:47:04.722" end="00:47:09.822" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Ashcroft was a priority guest.</p>
<p begin="00:47:06.822" end="00:47:09.822" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s not an answer.</p>
<p begin="00:47:10.522" end="00:47:14.422" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Claire paid months earlier. We offered</p>
<p begin="00:47:12.722" end="00:47:17.722" style="s2">compensation.</p>
<p begin="00:47:14.422" end="00:47:17.722" style="s2">&gt;&gt; After taking my room?</p>
<p begin="00:47:20.022" end="00:47:24.322" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We had an investor event that evening.</p>
<p begin="00:47:22.622" end="00:47:24.922" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So the event mattered more than my</p>
<p begin="00:47:24.322" end="00:47:28.322" style="s2">booking?</p>
<p begin="00:47:24.922" end="00:47:28.322" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We were trying to avoid disruption.</p>
<p begin="00:47:28.522" end="00:47:31.922" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You didn&#39;t even have another room ready.</p>
<p begin="00:47:32.322" end="00:47:37.122" style="s2">Two valid orders.</p>
<p begin="00:47:35.422" end="00:47:39.922" style="s2">Only confirmed cases that night.</p>
<p begin="00:47:37.122" end="00:47:39.922" style="s2">Alternative room.</p>
<p begin="00:47:43.422" end="00:47:48.122" style="s2">Was there a confirmed alternative room?</p>
<p begin="00:47:45.422" end="00:47:48.122" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not that evening.</p>
<p begin="00:47:49.322" end="00:47:53.022" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good. That&#39;s what I wanted on record.</p>
<p begin="00:48:03.122" end="00:48:07.622" style="s2">Now explain why a room dispute ended</p>
<p begin="00:48:05.022" end="00:48:07.622" style="s2">with this.</p>
<p begin="00:48:09.222" end="00:48:12.922" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The situation escalated when Miss</p>
<p begin="00:48:10.822" end="00:48:14.022" style="s2">Whitmore refused to cooperate.</p>
<p begin="00:48:12.922" end="00:48:15.722" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Cooperate with what?</p>
<p begin="00:48:14.022" end="00:48:19.122" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The staff&#39;s relocation plan.</p>
<p begin="00:48:15.722" end="00:48:19.122" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There wasn&#39;t another room.</p>
<p begin="00:48:20.122" end="00:48:22.722" style="s2">What about Oliver? Why did someone reach</p>
<p begin="00:48:22.322" end="00:48:24.422" style="s2">for him?</p>
<p begin="00:48:22.722" end="00:48:25.222" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The staff thought temporary nursery care</p>
<p begin="00:48:24.422" end="00:48:29.522" style="s2">might help.</p>
<p begin="00:48:25.222" end="00:48:29.522" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Help who? Me or your schedule?</p>
<p begin="00:48:36.822" end="00:48:43.522" style="s2">Watch my arms. He&#39;s already with me.</p>
<p begin="00:48:40.422" end="00:48:43.522" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t touch my son!</p>
<p begin="00:48:46.422" end="00:48:50.722" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did Miss Whitfield consent?</p>
<p begin="00:48:48.422" end="00:48:53.522" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She was extremely upset.</p>
<p begin="00:48:50.722" end="00:48:56.322" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I wasn&#39;t asked about my mood.</p>
<p begin="00:48:53.522" end="00:48:59.022" style="s2">I said no. Did your staff stop?</p>
<p begin="00:48:56.322" end="00:48:59.022" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not immediately.</p>
<p begin="00:49:07.024" end="00:49:10.824" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He was ten months old.</p>
<p begin="00:49:09.024" end="00:49:11.424" style="s2">What emergency required taking him from</p>
<p begin="00:49:10.824" end="00:49:13.224" style="s2">me?</p>
<p begin="00:49:11.424" end="00:49:16.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We were managing a difficult situation.</p>
<p begin="00:49:13.224" end="00:49:16.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That doesn&#39;t answer the question.</p>
<p begin="00:49:23.524" end="00:49:27.124" style="s2">Then let&#39;s ask the woman who gave the</p>
<p begin="00:49:24.824" end="00:49:27.124" style="s2">order.</p>
<p begin="00:49:28.324" end="00:49:31.824" style="s2">Chloe, tell us what happened.</p>
<p begin="00:49:32.024" end="00:49:35.724" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was told to take the baby.</p>
<p begin="00:49:33.924" end="00:49:38.224" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s not what I said. Victoria, let</p>
<p begin="00:49:35.724" end="00:49:38.224" style="s2">her finish.</p>
<p begin="00:49:38.624" end="00:49:41.624" style="s2">Chloe, who told you?</p>
<p begin="00:49:43.224" end="00:49:47.724" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Victoria did.</p>
<p begin="00:49:45.024" end="00:49:51.424" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I told you to help the guest.</p>
<p begin="00:49:47.724" end="00:49:51.424" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You said take the baby first.</p>
<p begin="00:49:52.924" end="00:49:55.924" style="s2">Take the baby first.</p>
<p begin="00:49:59.024" end="00:50:02.424" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We were under a lot of pressure. You</p>
<p begin="00:50:00.824" end="00:50:04.424" style="s2">heard me screaming no.</p>
<p begin="00:50:02.424" end="00:50:08.024" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:50:04.424" end="00:50:08.024" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And you kept telling her to do it.</p>
<p begin="00:50:10.724" end="00:50:14.124" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I should have stopped. I&#39;m sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:50:15.524" end="00:50:18.624" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you for telling the truth.</p>
<p begin="00:50:23.224" end="00:50:28.624" style="s2">I never wanted anyone hurt,</p>
<p begin="00:50:25.524" end="00:50:28.624" style="s2">but someone got hurt.</p>
<p begin="00:50:34.324" end="00:50:38.924" style="s2">Now I want to know why you were in such</p>
<p begin="00:50:36.524" end="00:50:38.924" style="s2">a hurry.</p>
<p begin="00:50:39.924" end="00:50:43.624" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because I kept getting calls from</p>
<p begin="00:50:41.124" end="00:50:43.624" style="s2">upstairs.</p>
<p begin="00:50:44.524" end="00:50:48.324" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Three calls in 20 minutes. The investor</p>
<p begin="00:50:46.424" end="00:50:50.724" style="s2">reception was about to start. Who was</p>
<p begin="00:50:48.324" end="00:50:50.724" style="s2">calling?</p>
<p begin="00:50:51.724" end="00:50:55.024" style="s2">Richard Vale.</p>
<p begin="00:50:53.724" end="00:50:56.024" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That doesn&#39;t mean he ordered anyone to</p>
<p begin="00:50:55.024" end="00:50:58.924" style="s2">touch a child.</p>
<p begin="00:50:56.024" end="00:50:58.924" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t say he did.</p>
<p begin="00:50:59.124" end="00:51:04.025" style="s2">Richard wanted the suite cleared.</p>
<p begin="00:51:01.624" end="00:51:04.925" style="s2">You chose how to do it. Correct?</p>
<p begin="00:51:04.025" end="00:51:06.525" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:51:04.925" end="00:51:07.725" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And Chloe followed your instruction?</p>
<p begin="00:51:06.525" end="00:51:08.925" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:51:07.725" end="00:51:10.925" style="s2">Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:51:08.925" end="00:51:11.725" style="s2">You don&#39;t get it. I thought I&#39;d be</p>
<p begin="00:51:10.925" end="00:51:13.825" style="s2">fired.</p>
<p begin="00:51:11.725" end="00:51:17.525" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I get being scared.</p>
<p begin="00:51:13.825" end="00:51:17.525" style="s2">I don&#39;t get taking someone&#39;s baby.</p>
<p begin="00:51:22.725" end="00:51:25.225" style="s2">Who approved that wording?</p>
<p begin="00:51:24.025" end="00:51:27.925" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It went through management.</p>
<p begin="00:51:25.225" end="00:51:27.925" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Which manager?</p>
<p begin="00:51:28.625" end="00:51:31.725" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Operations reviewed it.</p>
<p begin="00:51:39.495" end="00:51:41.515" style="s2">[panting]</p>
<p begin="00:51:43.725" end="00:51:46.625" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Pressure explains what you were</p>
<p begin="00:51:44.925" end="00:51:49.925" style="s2">thinking.</p>
<p begin="00:51:46.625" end="00:51:49.925" style="s2">It doesn&#39;t excuse what you did.</p>
<p begin="00:51:59.325" end="00:52:02.225" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Has she mentioned my name?</p>
<p begin="00:52:03.525" end="00:52:05.425" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s talk about what happened after I</p>
<p begin="00:52:05.125" end="00:52:06.925" style="s2">left.</p>
<p begin="00:52:05.425" end="00:52:08.225" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Public relations was a separate matter.</p>
<p begin="00:52:06.925" end="00:52:12.225" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Separate.</p>
<p begin="00:52:08.225" end="00:52:12.225" style="s2">Same incident, same lies.</p>
<p begin="00:52:14.825" end="00:52:17.125" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The first draft mentioned the double</p>
<p begin="00:52:16.325" end="00:52:19.825" style="s2">booking.</p>
<p begin="00:52:17.125" end="00:52:20.325" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And the final one blamed me. Who changed</p>
<p begin="00:52:19.825" end="00:52:22.025" style="s2">it?</p>
<p begin="00:52:20.325" end="00:52:24.425" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Our communications department.</p>
<p begin="00:52:22.025" end="00:52:24.425" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Name.</p>
<p begin="00:52:25.425" end="00:52:28.025" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dana Shaw.</p>
<p begin="00:52:28.225" end="00:52:33.525" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And who approved it?</p>
<p begin="00:52:30.025" end="00:52:33.525" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Richard Vile reviewed the response.</p>
<p begin="00:52:35.925" end="00:52:38.225" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your company also pressured the</p>
<p begin="00:52:37.325" end="00:52:41.125" style="s2">reporter.</p>
<p begin="00:52:38.225" end="00:52:44.525" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We were protecting our reputation.</p>
<p begin="00:52:41.125" end="00:52:44.525" style="s2">&gt;&gt; By making me look like a liar.</p>
<p begin="00:53:01.725" end="00:53:07.727" style="s2">You hurt us once in that room.</p>
<p begin="00:53:04.225" end="00:53:07.727" style="s2">Then you did it again online.</p>
<p begin="00:53:09.527" end="00:53:12.427" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why come to me now?</p>
<p begin="00:53:10.927" end="00:53:13.427" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because Eleanor is going to ruin all of</p>
<p begin="00:53:12.427" end="00:53:16.227" style="s2">us.</p>
<p begin="00:53:13.427" end="00:53:16.227" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What have you brought?</p>
<p begin="00:53:16.427" end="00:53:19.027" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Payments from the Ashcove breeding</p>
<p begin="00:53:17.727" end="00:53:21.127" style="s2">operation.</p>
<p begin="00:53:19.027" end="00:53:22.727" style="s2">Large ones.</p>
<p begin="00:53:21.127" end="00:53:24.427" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;re charging for an intensive</p>
<p begin="00:53:22.727" end="00:53:25.827" style="s2">treatment course during the period I</p>
<p begin="00:53:24.427" end="00:53:27.527" style="s2">assessed her.</p>
<p begin="00:53:25.827" end="00:53:29.427" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And?</p>
<p begin="00:53:27.527" end="00:53:31.327" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She wasn&#39;t on that program.</p>
<p begin="00:53:29.427" end="00:53:33.427" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you certain?</p>
<p begin="00:53:31.327" end="00:53:35.527" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I remember the case.</p>
<p begin="00:53:33.427" end="00:53:38.427" style="s2">But we&#39;ll need the actual records.</p>
<p begin="00:53:35.527" end="00:53:40.927" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Rehabilitation fees, thousands of pounds</p>
<p begin="00:53:38.427" end="00:53:41.627" style="s2">over and over. Eleanor approves the</p>
<p begin="00:53:40.927" end="00:53:43.127" style="s2">suppliers.</p>
<p begin="00:53:41.627" end="00:53:47.327" style="s2">&gt;&gt; High-level equine treatment can be</p>
<p begin="00:53:43.127" end="00:53:47.327" style="s2">expensive. That alone proves nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:53:48.327" end="00:53:51.927" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can you tell whether the treatments make</p>
<p begin="00:53:49.527" end="00:53:51.927" style="s2">sense?</p>
<p begin="00:53:53.927" end="00:53:56.927" style="s2">James, contact the independent</p>
<p begin="00:53:55.527" end="00:54:00.327" style="s2">veterinary team.</p>
<p begin="00:53:56.927" end="00:54:00.327" style="s2">I want these invoices checked.</p>
<p begin="00:54:01.227" end="00:54:03.527" style="s2">Then you believe me?</p>
<p begin="00:54:02.327" end="00:54:06.627" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If I know the horses and their</p>
<p begin="00:54:03.527" end="00:54:06.627" style="s2">conditions, yes.</p>
<p begin="00:54:10.327" end="00:54:13.127" style="s2">Wait.</p>
<p begin="00:54:11.527" end="00:54:14.227" style="s2">I know this horse.</p>
<p begin="00:54:13.127" end="00:54:16.127" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Which one?</p>
<p begin="00:54:14.227" end="00:54:17.327" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Silver Comet. I worked with her</p>
<p begin="00:54:16.127" end="00:54:18.627" style="s2">rehabilitation team.</p>
<p begin="00:54:17.327" end="00:54:21.527" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I believe there&#39;s something worth</p>
<p begin="00:54:18.627" end="00:54:21.527" style="s2">investigating.</p>
<p begin="00:54:27.127" end="00:54:31.227" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Adrian,</p>
<p begin="00:54:28.427" end="00:54:32.827" style="s2">I think this happened more than once.</p>
<p begin="00:54:31.227" end="00:54:34.927" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Silver Comet was recovering from a</p>
<p begin="00:54:32.827" end="00:54:37.427" style="s2">tendon injury.</p>
<p begin="00:54:34.927" end="00:54:39.227" style="s2">Her plan was controlled rest and gradual</p>
<p begin="00:54:37.427" end="00:54:40.727" style="s2">movement,</p>
<p begin="00:54:39.227" end="00:54:42.027" style="s2">not the intensive program on this</p>
<p begin="00:54:40.727" end="00:54:43.627" style="s2">invoice.</p>
<p begin="00:54:42.027" end="00:54:45.527" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Could the vet have changed the plan?</p>
<p begin="00:54:43.627" end="00:54:48.227" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Possible. That&#39; s why I asked the clinic</p>
<p begin="00:54:45.527" end="00:54:48.227" style="s2">to confirm.</p>
<p begin="00:54:50.827" end="00:54:54.227" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The clinic confirms they never provided</p>
<p begin="00:54:52.627" end="00:54:56.227" style="s2">the billed treatment.</p>
<p begin="00:54:54.227" end="00:54:57.327" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So someone billed the trust for work</p>
<p begin="00:54:56.227" end="00:54:59.327" style="s2">that wasn&#39;t done.</p>
<p begin="00:54:57.327" end="00:55:00.527" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And look at these other horses. Same</p>
<p begin="00:54:59.327" end="00:55:03.127" style="s2">treatment description, different</p>
<p begin="00:55:00.527" end="00:55:03.127" style="s2">conditions.</p>
<p begin="00:55:05.927" end="00:55:07.728" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who received the payments? A company</p>
<p begin="00:55:07.427" end="00:55:09.328" style="s2">called</p>
<p begin="00:55:07.728" end="00:55:10.028" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ashbridge Equine Services.</p>
<p begin="00:55:09.328" end="00:55:11.228" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who owns it?</p>
<p begin="00:55:10.028" end="00:55:13.828" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s controlled through a company linked</p>
<p begin="00:55:11.228" end="00:55:13.828" style="s2">to Lady Eleanor.</p>
<p begin="00:55:15.028" end="00:55:19.628" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So she&#39;s paying her own company for</p>
<p begin="00:55:17.128" end="00:55:21.428" style="s2">treatments that never happened.</p>
<p begin="00:55:19.628" end="00:55:22.728" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ll still need the full financial</p>
<p begin="00:55:21.428" end="00:55:23.528" style="s2">records.</p>
<p begin="00:55:22.728" end="00:55:24.728" style="s2">&gt;&gt; James?</p>
<p begin="00:55:23.528" end="00:55:26.528" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The independent reviewers are already</p>
<p begin="00:55:24.728" end="00:55:29.828" style="s2">working on them.</p>
<p begin="00:55:26.528" end="00:55:32.128" style="s2">I approved some of those invoices.</p>
<p begin="00:55:29.828" end="00:55:33.328" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Eleanor told me they were legitimate.</p>
<p begin="00:55:32.128" end="00:55:33.928" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Will you tell the reviewers exactly what</p>
<p begin="00:55:33.328" end="00:55:37.928" style="s2">happened?</p>
<p begin="00:55:33.928" end="00:55:37.928" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes. I&#39;m done covering for her.</p>
<p begin="00:55:39.228" end="00:55:40.928" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You spotted something everyone else</p>
<p begin="00:55:40.328" end="00:55:42.628" style="s2">missed.</p>
<p begin="00:55:40.928" end="00:55:45.228" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know horses. They can&#39;t sign false</p>
<p begin="00:55:42.628" end="00:55:45.228" style="s2">invoices.</p>
<p begin="00:55:51.228" end="00:55:54.528" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your Grace,</p>
<p begin="00:55:52.628" end="00:55:55.228" style="s2">Lady Eleanor has called a family</p>
<p begin="00:55:54.528" end="00:55:55.828" style="s2">meeting.</p>
<p begin="00:55:55.228" end="00:55:56.928" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When?</p>
<p begin="00:55:55.828" end="00:56:00.428" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:55:56.928" end="00:56:00.428" style="s2">And she&#39;s demanding Oliver attend.</p>
<p begin="00:56:01.428" end="00:56:04.928" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Adrian,</p>
<p begin="00:56:02.728" end="00:56:07.128" style="s2">and you&#39;ve brought the horse cancer.</p>
<p begin="00:56:04.928" end="00:56:08.328" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Claire Bennett, you can use my name.</p>
<p begin="00:56:07.128" end="00:56:09.928" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How bold.</p>
<p begin="00:56:08.328" end="00:56:13.228" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re here because you demanded Oliver</p>
<p begin="00:56:09.928" end="00:56:16.928" style="s2">attend. Keep this respectful.</p>
<p begin="00:56:13.228" end="00:56:18.228" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oliver, darling, come sit with me.</p>
<p begin="00:56:16.928" end="00:56:19.328" style="s2">Do you know what awaits you in this</p>
<p begin="00:56:18.228" end="00:56:21.028" style="s2">family?</p>
<p begin="00:56:19.328" end="00:56:22.628" style="s2">Estates,</p>
<p begin="00:56:21.028" end="00:56:24.128" style="s2">investments,</p>
<p begin="00:56:22.628" end="00:56:25.828" style="s2">the finest education.</p>
<p begin="00:56:24.128" end="00:56:28.128" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I already go to school.</p>
<p begin="00:56:25.828" end="00:56:29.328" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You could have so much more.</p>
<p begin="00:56:28.128" end="00:56:31.928" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Instead, you&#39;re spending time with</p>
<p begin="00:56:29.328" end="00:56:33.828" style="s2">someone who cleans up after horses.</p>
<p begin="00:56:31.928" end="00:56:35.828" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I help injured animals recover. There&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:56:33.828" end="00:56:37.728" style="s2">nothing shameful about that.</p>
<p begin="00:56:35.828" end="00:56:40.628" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re not his blood.</p>
<p begin="00:56:37.728" end="00:56:40.628" style="s2">You never will be.</p>
<p begin="00:56:42.728" end="00:56:48.128" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop talking about my mum like that.</p>
<p begin="00:56:46.128" end="00:56:51.328" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your mother was my family&#39;s daughter.</p>
<p begin="00:56:48.128" end="00:56:53.228" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know. Dad tells me about her.</p>
<p begin="00:56:51.328" end="00:56:55.628" style="s2">But Claire is here.</p>
<p begin="00:56:53.228" end="00:56:59.128" style="s2">She helps me when I&#39;m sad.</p>
<p begin="00:56:55.628" end="00:56:59.128" style="s2">She remembers what I like.</p>
<p begin="00:57:00.128" end="00:57:04.528" style="s2">She&#39;s my mum, and I&#39;m not leaving her.</p>
<p begin="00:57:06.528" end="00:57:09.728" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m right here, sweetheart.</p>
<p begin="00:57:10.528" end="00:57:14.629" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You You affection inheritance law?</p>
<p begin="00:57:13.529" end="00:57:16.429" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:57:14.629" end="00:57:18.929" style="s2">And inheritance law doesn&#39;t decide who</p>
<p begin="00:57:16.429" end="00:57:18.929" style="s2">Oliver loves.</p>
<p begin="00:57:22.729" end="00:57:26.129" style="s2">Now Eleanor,</p>
<p begin="00:57:24.929" end="00:57:28.629" style="s2">let&#39;s talk about the money you took from</p>
<p begin="00:57:26.129" end="00:57:28.629" style="s2">his trust.</p>
<p begin="00:57:28.929" end="00:57:33.529" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What exactly are you accusing me of?</p>
<p begin="00:57:31.029" end="00:57:35.629" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Approving false rehabilitation invoices</p>
<p begin="00:57:33.529" end="00:57:36.429" style="s2">and sending trust money to a company you</p>
<p begin="00:57:35.629" end="00:57:38.529" style="s2">control.</p>
<p begin="00:57:36.429" end="00:57:39.429" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nonsense. Those were legitimate</p>
<p begin="00:57:38.529" end="00:57:41.129" style="s2">treatments.</p>
<p begin="00:57:39.429" end="00:57:43.929" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then why does the clinic have no record</p>
<p begin="00:57:41.129" end="00:57:43.929" style="s2">of providing them?</p>
<p begin="00:57:44.329" end="00:57:48.329" style="s2">I worked on one of those cases.</p>
<p begin="00:57:46.629" end="00:57:48.729" style="s2">The invoices didn&#39;t match the treatment</p>
<p begin="00:57:48.329" end="00:57:50.829" style="s2">plan.</p>
<p begin="00:57:48.729" end="00:57:52.029" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re a therapist, not an accountant.</p>
<p begin="00:57:50.829" end="00:57:53.229" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly.</p>
<p begin="00:57:52.029" end="00:57:54.729" style="s2">I spotted the treatment that never</p>
<p begin="00:57:53.229" end="00:57:56.429" style="s2">happened.</p>
<p begin="00:57:54.729" end="00:57:58.729" style="s2">The independent reviewers traced the</p>
<p begin="00:57:56.429" end="00:57:58.729" style="s2">money.</p>
<p begin="00:57:59.929" end="00:58:02.729" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The payments went to a company linked to</p>
<p begin="00:58:01.729" end="00:58:05.029" style="s2">Lady Eleanor.</p>
<p begin="00:58:02.729" end="00:58:07.429" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Richard approved them.</p>
<p begin="00:58:05.029" end="00:58:09.529" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because you instructed me to.</p>
<p begin="00:58:07.429" end="00:58:10.629" style="s2">I have the messages.</p>
<p begin="00:58:09.529" end="00:58:12.729" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You traitor.</p>
<p begin="00:58:10.629" end="00:58:14.129" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I should have spoken up sooner.</p>
<p begin="00:58:12.729" end="00:58:16.429" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The evidence warrants immediate</p>
<p begin="00:58:14.129" end="00:58:18.429" style="s2">protective action. Lady Eleanor&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:58:16.429" end="00:58:21.329" style="s2">relevant management authority is being</p>
<p begin="00:58:18.429" end="00:58:23.329" style="s2">suspended pending formal review.</p>
<p begin="00:58:21.329" end="00:58:24.229" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You think you&#39;ve won? The boy is still</p>
<p begin="00:58:23.329" end="00:58:25.729" style="s2">an ash bomb.</p>
<p begin="00:58:24.229" end="00:58:27.729" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And he&#39;ll remain one.</p>
<p begin="00:58:25.729" end="00:58:30.129" style="s2">That doesn&#39;t make him your property.</p>
<p begin="00:58:27.729" end="00:58:32.629" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I already told you, I&#39;m staying with mum</p>
<p begin="00:58:30.129" end="00:58:35.829" style="s2">and dad.</p>
<p begin="00:58:32.629" end="00:58:35.829" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come on sweetheart, let&#39;s go home.</p>
<p begin="00:58:36.629" end="00:58:40.129" style="s2">&gt;&gt; For the record, this is Claire, my</p>
<p begin="00:58:38.229" end="00:58:42.529" style="s2">fiancee, and the mother Oliver has</p>
<p begin="00:58:40.129" end="00:58:42.529" style="s2">chosen.</p>
<p begin="00:58:44.129" end="00:58:47.229" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s over. We can finally have the</p>
<p begin="00:58:45.929" end="00:58:48.529" style="s2">wedding.</p>
<p begin="00:58:47.229" end="00:58:49.329" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You still have to survive being the ring</p>
<p begin="00:58:48.529" end="00:58:49.929" style="s2">bearer.</p>
<p begin="00:58:49.329" end="00:58:51.329" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Easy.</p>
<p begin="00:58:49.929" end="00:58:54.329" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You lost your school tie yesterday.</p>
<p begin="00:58:51.329" end="00:58:54.329" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That was different.</p>
<p begin="00:58:54.629" end="00:59:00.029" style="s2">Dad, when are you finally marrying mum?</p>
<p begin="00:58:58.529" end="00:59:02.829" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t lose the rings.</p>
<p begin="00:59:00.029" end="00:59:04.129" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m 10 Sophie. I can handle two rings.</p>
<p begin="00:59:02.829" end="00:59:07.829" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You lost your shoes last week.</p>
<p begin="00:59:04.129" end="00:59:07.829" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I found them in the garden.</p>
<p begin="00:59:08.029" end="00:59:10.629" style="s2">Anyway, none of this would be happening</p>
<p begin="00:59:09.829" end="00:59:13.631" style="s2">without me.</p>
<p begin="00:59:10.629" end="00:59:13.631" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You didn&#39;t everything.</p>
<p begin="00:59:17.230" end="00:59:22.031" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You look beautiful.</p>
<p begin="00:59:18.831" end="00:59:22.031" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t look too bad yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:59:25.031" end="00:59:28.331" style="s2">I cared whether you were looking after</p>
<p begin="00:59:26.531" end="00:59:31.431" style="s2">your boy.</p>
<p begin="00:59:28.331" end="00:59:33.031" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And you taught me that a family</p>
<p begin="00:59:31.431" end="00:59:34.531" style="s2">isn&#39;t something I can provide with money</p>
<p begin="00:59:33.031" end="00:59:35.730" style="s2">alone.</p>
<p begin="00:59:34.531" end="00:59:38.931" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You taught me I don&#39;t have to carry</p>
<p begin="00:59:35.730" end="00:59:38.931" style="s2">everything by myself.</p>
<p begin="00:59:39.931" end="00:59:45.031" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No more secrets, no more tests, just us</p>
<p begin="00:59:43.230" end="00:59:48.931" style="s2">facing everything together.</p>
<p begin="00:59:45.031" end="00:59:48.931" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And both our children, always.</p>
<p begin="00:59:52.230" end="00:59:56.031" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve got one question.</p>
<p begin="00:59:55.031" end="00:59:59.031" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course you do.</p>
<p begin="00:59:56.031" end="00:59:59.031" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did I pick the right mom?</p>
<p begin="00:59:59.931" end="01:00:01.931" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You gave us something I couldn&#39;t buy</p>
<p begin="01:00:01.131" end="01:00:02.631" style="s2">Oliver.</p>
<p begin="01:00:01.931" end="01:00:05.230" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="01:00:02.631" end="01:00:05.230" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A family.</p>
<p begin="01:00:05.931" end="01:00:10.331" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And I got two wonderful children.</p>
<p begin="01:00:08.931" end="01:00:12.931" style="s2">Even if one of them is annoying.</p>
<p begin="01:00:10.331" end="01:00:12.931" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey!</p>
<p begin="01:00:13.931" end="01:00:15.831" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom?</p>
<p begin="01:00:14.831" end="01:00:17.831" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, sweetheart.</p>
<p begin="01:00:15.831" end="01:00:20.331" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m glad I chose you.</p>
<p begin="01:00:17.831" end="01:00:20.331" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So am I.</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
